<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (To make the controller visually convincing, I used AI tool to generate soba noodle textures and inserted them inside each bowl. This not only gave the illusion of real noodles inside but also helped create an immediate visual connection between the game and the physical controller.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [8]
>>
