/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 124 0 R
/E (To maintain both functionality and visual consistency, I created my own handcrafted salmon slices and fried eggs using modelling dough. These toppings were designed with flat bases so I could embed small aluminum foil pads underneath each one. This solution allowed me to build buttons that were both conductive and aesthetically in line with the food concept.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
